:"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027618607","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108198#issuecomment-3027618607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108198","id":3027618607,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60dcsv","user":{"login":"thygrrr","id":8904620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDQ2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8904620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr","html_url":"https://github.com/thygrrr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T12:03:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T12:04:45Z","body":"```cs\nC:\\Tools\\godot\\Godot_v4.5-beta2_mono_win64\\Godot_v4.5-beta2_mono_win64.exe --version\n4.5.beta1.mono.official.46c495ca2\n```\n\nDoesn't hang on Windows 11 for current \"4.5-beta2\" with dotnet, which reports the wrong version, likely due to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108190 (so it may be the 4.5-beta1 build after all)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027618607/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3044813769","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108198#issuecomment-3044813769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108198","id":3044813769,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61fCvJ","user":{"login":"madebydavid","id":5401249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDEyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5401249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid","html_url":"https://github.com/madebydavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T12:21:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T12:21:33Z","body":"I have done a little more digging into this issue.\n\n- It is not related to the `--version` flag - that is just a simple example of the issue\n  - Any headless / standalone-tool commands also fail unless I have a macOS GUI session started\n  e.g `--help`, `--check-only`, `--export-release` also hang\n\n- I tested compiling on macOS and running with versions of the code from before and after macOS related [commits between 4.5-dev1 and 4.5-dev2](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/97241ffe...af2c7139)\n\n  - The build from [this commit](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0595bb8a4219f6f02dedcca8b0a65e5db29992d8) **does not have** the issue\n  - The build from [this commit](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/a317ce75a6564f090d1c8cbd7feb21a9d7d92c67) **has** the issue - the commit is related to \"macOS main loop\"\n\nI am happy to assist debugging this further.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3044813769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]